{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐通红着脸点了点头。", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "初吻的感觉依然记忆犹新。", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不曾想过接吻能如此使人心醉……", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……妈妈说要好好用舌头」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1477", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「试试吧？」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1478", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐再次点了点头。我将她的下巴轻轻举起，吻了下去。", "text_idx": 184, "plain": "学姐再次点了点头。我将她的下巴轻轻举起，吻了下去。", "plain_idx": 184, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抓住她的双肩，变换着舌头交缠的角度。", "text_idx": 185, "plain": "我抓住她的双肩，变换着舌头交缠的角度。", "plain_idx": 185, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、啾，哧溜，嗯、哈……」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": "「嗯、啾，哧溜，嗯、哈……」", "plain_idx": 186, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1479", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最初只是相互试探对方的舌头。", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的呼吸变得沉重。", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身体有种轻飘飘的感觉。", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啾、嗯嗯，哧，啾、嗯……」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": "「啾、嗯嗯，哧，啾、嗯……」", "plain_idx": 191, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1480", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我开始吮吸学姐的舌头，她的双肩也因被吓了一跳而颤了颤。", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊呜，嗯、啾……」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1481", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐也主动吮吸起我的舌头。这次到我被吓一跳了。", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "学姐也主动吮吸起我的舌头。这次到我被吓一跳了。", "plain_idx": 196, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，新吾……」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1482", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、啾、嗯呜、嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": "「嗯、啾、嗯呜、嗯嗯……」", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1483", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的舌头比我稍长，动作也更加丝滑娴熟。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来是抓住了技巧，学姐的攻势变得激烈。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一边交缠一边吮吸，稍不留意便会被其压倒。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": "一边交缠一边吮吸，稍不留意便会被其压倒。", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，学姐……」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啾……有变得熟练么……」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1484", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啾……嗯……\\n　新吾，我已经快动不了了……」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": "「啾……嗯……　新吾，我已经快动不了了……」", "plain_idx": 208, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1485", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐又吸住了我的舌头，一脸愉悦地玩弄我直到结束。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": "学姐又吸住了我的舌头，一脸愉悦地玩弄我直到结束。", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "越来越不想学习了。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只想一整天和学姐在接吻中度过。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那不行，必须得学习了」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1486", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽老师太残忍了」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天下午还得打工，没时间学习了……」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1487", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那打工前一直学习吧」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学英语吗？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1488", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，学接吻」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1489", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我望着学姐害羞的模样，用指尖轻轻抚摸着她的双唇。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐将我的手指含住，轻轻颔首。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "学姐将我的手指含住，轻轻颔首。", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾……嗯？！啾、嗯嗯，嗯、啾？！」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "「新吾……嗯？！啾、嗯嗯，嗯、啾？！」", "plain_idx": 225, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1490", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与美羽老师的秘密学习，不曾中断过……", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "与美羽老师的秘密学习，不曾中断过……", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，怎么了？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0116", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一直无精打采的……」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0117", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不……」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐出门打工了，结子邀请了正要回家的我喝茶。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "美羽学姐出门打工了，结子邀请了正要回家的我喝茶。", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "脑子一片糨糊。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和美羽学姐一直亲热到打工时间。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在依然留有美羽学姐双唇的触感。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，面对与美羽学姐相似的结子阿姨的双唇，我的心中一片悸动。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "而且，面对与美羽学姐相似的结子阿姨的双唇，我的心中一片悸动。", "plain_idx": 239, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「复习还顺利吗？」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0118", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，还行……」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我俩一直在接吻这事肯定是不能说的。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "加之结子阿姨的体香让我无法适应。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的样子完全看不出是人妻。\\n穿上结女的校服走在校园一定没有违和感……", "text_idx": 245, "plain": "她的样子完全看不出是人妻。穿上结女的校服走在校园一定没有违和感……", "plain_idx": 246, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样啊，我还以为你们会在屋内进行接吻的练习呢……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": "「这样啊，我还以为你们会在屋内进行接吻的练习呢……」", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0119", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噗？！」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那孩子昨晚老烦人了」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0120", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说着自己是姐姐，所以要比新吾更熟练之类的话」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": "「说着自己是姐姐，所以要比新吾更熟练之类的话」", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0121", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要我教她接吻的技巧……」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0122", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个……最后结子阿姨还是教给她了？」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，你猜呢？」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0123", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "呜哇，肯定教了。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来刚才的都是结子阿姨的亲传……", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回想起来，嘴唇又变得寂寞起来。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，亲子关系真好啊。\\n　这种事也能彼此交流……」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": "「不过，亲子关系真好啊。　这种事也能彼此交流……」", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是么？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0124", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，这种亦亲亦友的关系，令人羡慕」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果结子阿姨是我的母亲，我一定会变成世界第一母控的。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "如果结子阿姨是我的母亲，我一定会变成世界第一母控的。", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谁都别想碰我的母亲”这种的。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不过，作为母亲我是失职的」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0125", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结子出乎意料的话语让我在椅子上一个没坐稳晃了一下。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我没法抚平美羽心中的伤痕……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "「我没法抚平美羽心中的伤痕……」", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0126", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「心中的伤痕……？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结子阿姨看我抚摸着腿上的猫。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "结子阿姨看我抚摸着腿上的猫。", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其实，美羽养不了动物」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0127", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「养不了动物是什么意思？过敏吗……？」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「养不了动物是什么意思？过敏吗……？」", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，并不是」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0128", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽小时候养的猫，因病死掉了……」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "「美羽小时候养的猫，因病死掉了……」", "plain_idx": 281, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0129", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样的打击使得美羽开始害怕饲养动物」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": "「这样的打击使得美羽开始害怕饲养动物」", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0130", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明知如此，之后我还是领养了卡琳和多蒙……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「明知如此，之后我还是领养了卡琳和多蒙……」", "plain_idx": 285, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0131", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可是……」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那孩子对动物的爱太过深沉」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0132", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「即使是寿终正寝，美羽也还是会陷入自责」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "「即使是寿终正寝，美羽也还是会陷入自责」", "plain_idx": 290, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0133", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等到卡琳与多蒙离开的那一天时，美羽肯定还会……」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": "「等到卡琳与多蒙离开的那一天时，美羽肯定还会……」", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0134", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而让女儿陷入自责，是母亲的失职」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0135", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有的事。结子阿姨是一位非常好的母亲」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": "「没有的事。结子阿姨是一位非常好的母亲」", "plain_idx": 296, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0136", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这既非同情也非客套话，而是我打心底这么认为。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "猫猫们也像是要支持结子阿姨一样，依偎在结子阿姨身旁。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "猫猫们也像是要支持结子阿姨一样，依偎在结子阿姨身旁。", "plain_idx": 299, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢。\\n　今后美羽就拜托你了」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": "「谢谢。　今后美羽就拜托你了」", "plain_idx": 301, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0137", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我相信，美羽学姐也是这么想的。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "露出这般笑容的结子阿姨是天底下最好的母亲——", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "露出这般笑容的结子阿姨是天底下最好的母亲——", "plain_idx": 304, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妈妈没做什么奇怪的事吧？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1491", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有。比起这个，今天就好好休息吧」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "「没有。比起这个，今天就好好休息吧」", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1492", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐恋恋不舍地握着我的手。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我决定暂时不对她说今天的事。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不愿让美羽学姐想起去世的猫。我想让她一直保持着笑容。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "我不愿让美羽学姐想起去世的猫。我想让她一直保持着笑容。", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，最后还是没能复习……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1493", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，该道歉的是我」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过……今天和新吾亲了好久……」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": "「不过……今天和新吾亲了好久……」", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1494", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……现在还想亲一下」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1495", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好呀」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？！啾、嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1496", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们牵着彼此的手，沉醉地深吻着。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的身上，逐渐沾染上美羽学姐那与结子阿姨相同的香味。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……接吻真让人着迷」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1497", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，超乎想象」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1498", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过……还有比接吻更舒服的事吧？」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「不过……还有比接吻更舒服的事吧？」", "plain_idx": 328, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1499", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1500", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「光是想想就受不了了……」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，真是想象不到还有比接吻更刺激的事……」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": "「……嗯，真是想象不到还有比接吻更刺激的事……」", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1501", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是有朝一日，我们同样会经历的事。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "到那时，我们会变成什么样……实在是难以想象。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": "到那时，我们会变成什么样……实在是难以想象。", "plain_idx": 335, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，再亲一次好吗？」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1502", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管多少次都没问题」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说这种话我可是会当真的」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": "「说这种话我可是会当真的」", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1503", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结子阿姨的亲传吻技使我心神荡漾，欲罢不能……", "text_idx": 341, "plain": "结子阿姨的亲传吻技使我心神荡漾，欲罢不能……", "plain_idx": 341, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
